WEBVTT

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

02:06.007 --> 02:07.717
You need to shoot it, Akira!

02:07.801 --> 02:09.719
It'll kill me if you don't shoot it!

02:09.803 --> 02:11.805
Goddammit! Why…

02:12.305 --> 02:13.723
Why won't you…

02:13.807 --> 02:16.226
…just do it! Now!

02:16.893 --> 02:17.978
Shoot it already!

02:18.687 --> 02:20.021
Someone kill it!

02:22.274 --> 02:23.733
Can anyone hear me?

02:35.620 --> 02:36.454
Yomiko.

02:38.165 --> 02:41.168
I… I wasn't good enough to avenge you.

02:44.963 --> 02:46.506
<i>Why isn't it killing me?</i>

02:50.051 --> 02:52.512
<i>I can't hear it.</i>

02:54.681 --> 02:55.932
Vine!

02:56.016 --> 02:57.100
I need you to come out!

02:57.184 --> 02:58.185
Please!

02:58.935 --> 03:00.228
Shit!

03:04.274 --> 03:05.442
If you won't come out…

03:19.998 --> 03:21.458
Why haven't you…

03:21.541 --> 03:23.710
Why haven't you killed me yet?

03:24.419 --> 03:26.922
Why are you going after Yomiko?

03:27.005 --> 03:28.548
Do you understand me?

03:28.632 --> 03:29.966
Answer me!

03:41.728 --> 03:44.981
<i>That woman, she took my sister from me.</i>

03:45.899 --> 03:47.525
Let's see what's behind here.

04:03.500 --> 04:06.419
REINA

04:06.503 --> 04:07.837
KENTA

04:09.256 --> 04:12.175
AIKA

04:12.592 --> 04:13.885
All of these are…

04:13.969 --> 04:15.428
Human-Sourced Furniture.

04:15.512 --> 04:17.138
It's probably all illegal.

04:18.265 --> 04:21.685
SHIIKA

04:23.353 --> 04:25.814
<i>My sister was chosen for the Parade.</i>

04:26.523 --> 04:29.192
<i>That woman was the only one</i>
<i>who could stop the Parade.</i>

04:30.151 --> 04:31.403
<i>She knew the truth,</i>

04:31.486 --> 04:34.197
<i>but she still put Shiika</i>
<i>through Transfloration.</i>

04:39.369 --> 04:43.331
<i>This is the first time</i>
<i>that I could tell someone.</i>

04:46.251 --> 04:48.169
<i>The way it talks,</i>

04:48.253 --> 04:49.838
<i>the size of its skull,</i>

04:50.964 --> 04:53.842
<i>this thing… it's a child.</i>

04:56.011 --> 04:57.220
<i>Where is she?</i>

04:57.304 --> 04:58.722
<i>That woman.</i>

04:58.805 --> 05:01.975
So, this is all over some
petty grudge that you have?

05:02.058 --> 05:04.728
All right, I don't know
what this "Parade" thing is,

05:04.811 --> 05:06.604
but Yomiko was only ever doing her job.

05:06.688 --> 05:09.107
She didn't deserve to be stabbed!

05:09.774 --> 05:10.775
Not her.

05:10.859 --> 05:12.402
It never should've been her.

05:13.320 --> 05:15.613
What if she's no longer able to smile?

05:16.573 --> 05:18.783
<i>My sister is no longer able to smile.</i>

05:18.867 --> 05:20.869
<i>It's that woman's fault.</i>

05:21.619 --> 05:24.873
<i>There wasn't</i>
<i>a single good thing about living.</i>

05:28.251 --> 05:30.420
<i>It was freezing cold where I was born.</i>

05:30.503 --> 05:32.130
<i>There were no schools.</i>

05:32.964 --> 05:34.883
<i>I never had a full stomach.</i>

05:35.967 --> 05:38.428
<i>I was always forced</i>
<i>to take care of dying people.</i>

05:41.056 --> 05:42.974
<i>Why did I have to…</i>

05:46.269 --> 05:49.522
<i>That's why it should be the same way</i>
<i>for everyone else.</i>

06:15.548 --> 06:16.716
Where'd that come from?

06:16.800 --> 06:18.843
What's going on?

06:18.927 --> 06:20.136
What is that thing?

06:20.220 --> 06:22.972
<i>I have to put out the fire.</i>

06:26.059 --> 06:27.811
What is that? What is…

06:27.894 --> 06:29.062
Run!

06:29.646 --> 06:30.980
<i>Why…</i>

06:31.648 --> 06:32.982
<i>Why won't it go out?</i>

06:54.170 --> 06:56.256
<i>It seemed like I was finally free.</i>

06:56.840 --> 07:00.093
<i>I had… I'd stopped feeling so cold.</i>

07:03.513 --> 07:07.142
<i>And I met someone like me.</i>

07:10.812 --> 07:14.315
<i>Thank you for listening to me.</i>

07:19.487 --> 07:20.780
<i>At 8:18 p.m. today,</i>

07:20.905 --> 07:23.324
<i>an unidentified creature</i>
<i>covered in flames</i>

07:23.408 --> 07:26.453
<i>suddenly appeared</i>
<i>on 5th Street in Spora Square.</i>

07:26.536 --> 07:27.954
<i>It attacked everyone in its path,</i>

07:28.037 --> 07:31.541
<i>leaving eight people seriously injured</i>
<i>and 31 dead.</i>

07:33.209 --> 07:34.294
<i>According to experts,</i>

07:34.377 --> 07:38.798
<i>the creature was likely someone</i>
<i>in Late-Stage Transfloration.</i>

07:42.385 --> 07:44.053
I was gonna say,

07:44.137 --> 07:45.805
that show you told me about the other day,

07:45.889 --> 07:47.390
you're right, it's so funny.

07:47.474 --> 07:48.641
I loved when…

07:51.060 --> 07:53.563
Here's your Western-style,
quasi-hamburger steak.

07:53.646 --> 07:56.232
Is there anything else I can get for you?

07:56.858 --> 07:57.817
No, we're all set.

08:02.405 --> 08:03.323
What's wrong?

08:04.115 --> 08:06.159
Don't worry about me.
Go ahead and eat.

08:10.121 --> 08:13.208
Yo… mi… ko…

08:20.131 --> 08:21.549
Yeah, I'm right here.

08:35.188 --> 08:38.608
You realize you turned
a valuable research subject into ash?

08:39.108 --> 08:40.443
This is bullshit!

08:40.527 --> 08:41.569
Hey!

08:41.653 --> 08:43.530
This is a hospital, quit shouting.

08:43.613 --> 08:45.740
Wake up, Akira, you little shit!

08:45.823 --> 08:46.908
Calm down.

08:47.367 --> 08:48.493
Hey!

08:49.160 --> 08:50.161
Huh?

08:51.246 --> 08:54.666
If you don't feel like getting hurt,
I suggest you leave.

08:56.459 --> 08:59.212
They brought so many flowers
with them this time.

08:59.295 --> 09:02.465
- I know, I wasn't expecting it.
- I'm so grateful.

09:02.549 --> 09:05.552
- They're always so good to us.
- <i>…no vacuum zones</i>

09:05.635 --> 09:07.011
<i>within the metropolitan area.</i>

09:07.095 --> 09:08.429
I got you cocoa.

09:08.888 --> 09:09.931
Thanks.

09:10.014 --> 09:12.350
<i>However, if you plan on visiting areas</i>
<i>near the boundary zones,</i>

09:12.433 --> 09:15.687
<i>conditions remain uncertain</i>
<i>heading into the weekend…</i>

09:15.770 --> 09:18.064
How is everything with your stomach?

09:18.815 --> 09:20.567
They told me it all looked good!

09:21.067 --> 09:23.486
I mean, I'll be eating a lot less
than I used to…

09:23.570 --> 09:26.155
But I'll be able to eat greasy
and solid foods still.

09:26.239 --> 09:28.449
I'll be eating a lot of soup
before I get to do that though.

09:29.242 --> 09:30.952
That's great.

09:31.703 --> 09:32.745
Really great.

09:33.538 --> 09:34.956
<i>Now for the news.</i>

09:35.039 --> 09:36.749
Come on, Toshiro, what are you crying for?

09:36.833 --> 09:39.127
<i>Authorities have identified</i>
<i>all the victims in the recent attack</i>

09:39.210 --> 09:41.629
<i>by a person in Late Stage Transfloration.</i>

09:42.297 --> 09:43.214
DECEASED

09:43.298 --> 09:47.010
<i>We will now display the names of those</i>
<i>who lost their lives in this attack.</i>

09:48.720 --> 09:50.680
<i>We offer our deepest condolences.</i>

09:51.472 --> 09:53.975
Well, I have to go and get
a test done right now.

09:54.601 --> 09:55.852
Oh, 'kay.

09:58.646 --> 10:01.649
<i>Locals have said the scene of the attack</i>
<i>still smells like smoke…</i>

10:01.733 --> 10:04.068
<i>There weren't any children</i>
<i>among the corpses.</i>

10:05.486 --> 10:08.406
<i>No child-sized skulls were found either.</i>

10:09.282 --> 10:11.826
<i>Authorities have stated</i>
<i>that identifying the attacker</i>

10:11.909 --> 10:13.328
<i>is proving to be difficult.</i>

10:13.411 --> 10:16.623
<i>The National Police Headquarters</i>
<i>is continuing its investigation</i>

10:16.706 --> 10:20.376
<i>into this incident that occurred</i>
<i>at the bustling Spora Square.</i>

10:20.460 --> 10:23.379
<i>They believe that it's closely related</i>
<i>to another series of murders in the area.</i>

10:23.463 --> 10:25.214
<i>Ivy's not dead yet.</i>

10:33.890 --> 10:35.350
Oh, you're awake.

10:36.225 --> 10:38.227
Good morning, sunshine.

10:46.069 --> 10:47.195
Hey.

10:49.864 --> 10:52.992
Do you have any idea how much of a mess
you've all created?

10:53.618 --> 10:55.244
Especially you!

10:55.328 --> 10:57.705
You stole a damn gun
from one of our officers.

10:57.789 --> 11:00.583
If you had just followed orders
and left it to us,

11:00.667 --> 11:02.877
the situation wouldn't have been this bad.

11:02.960 --> 11:05.630
You're really going to pin all this on us?

11:05.713 --> 11:09.384
You guys made those incendiary bullets,
so shouldn't you be responsible for--

11:09.467 --> 11:11.969
At any rate, he needs to be punished
for what he did!

11:12.512 --> 11:13.721
Wait a second!

11:13.805 --> 11:16.099
Without that gun, I would be dead now.

11:16.182 --> 11:18.935
And Ivy would still be out there
killing innocent civilians.

11:19.018 --> 11:21.270
The fact that the gun saved you
shows you needed us.

11:21.354 --> 11:23.106
If everything could be
resolved on its own,

11:23.189 --> 11:24.774
there would be no need for the police.

11:24.857 --> 11:27.360
Well, in reality, we didn't need you.

11:27.443 --> 11:28.486
What?

11:28.569 --> 11:30.113
When Transflora Medical makes a mess,

11:30.196 --> 11:32.448
who do you think
has to come in to clean it up?

11:32.532 --> 11:36.369
Don't you realize all the tragedies
that happen whenever you're involved?

11:36.452 --> 11:37.829
Enough is enough!

11:37.912 --> 11:39.080
You're under arrest!

11:39.163 --> 11:42.917
For theft, obstruction of justice,
and violation of the Firearms Control Act.

11:43.000 --> 11:46.087
With charges like those,
you'll be in prison for three years!

11:46.713 --> 11:47.839
Three years?

11:47.922 --> 11:49.382
No, wait a second!

11:49.465 --> 11:51.217
I'm begging you not to do that.

11:51.300 --> 11:54.053
Toshiro, he just underwent…
Transfloration.

11:54.137 --> 11:56.180
He doesn't…
He doesn't even have that…

11:56.264 --> 11:58.808
- None of that makes a difference.
- I gotta say…

11:58.891 --> 12:02.812
I think we should take into consideration
the fact that they defeated Ivy.

12:03.312 --> 12:04.605
Ms. Himejima.

12:04.689 --> 12:07.525
A one-year suspension
seems appropriate to me.

12:12.989 --> 12:14.824
I'll take responsibility, too.

12:15.616 --> 12:18.077
Could you just split that year
into six months for each of us?

12:18.161 --> 12:20.872
I… I'll take responsibility, as well!

12:20.955 --> 12:22.457
Four months each for the three of us.

12:23.875 --> 12:26.544
Or just make it three months each
for the four of us.

12:27.170 --> 12:31.090
All right, then including me,
a year divided by five is around…

12:31.174 --> 12:32.425
Twelve… five…

12:32.508 --> 12:33.801
Seventy-three days each.

12:33.885 --> 12:35.720
You realize you don't even work with us.

12:35.803 --> 12:37.597
Hey! Enough of this!

12:42.143 --> 12:44.854
All right, with Ivy dead now,

12:44.937 --> 12:47.732
I think that our chief here doesn't know
what to do with himself.

12:47.815 --> 12:50.401
Why don't we just settle this
with a pay cut?

12:52.904 --> 12:56.032
Hmm. You know that they should be
punished for what they did.

12:56.115 --> 12:58.743
No, that's just
your emotions talking, honey.

12:59.285 --> 13:02.789
If the higher-ups hate you,
you won't get promoted in the future.

13:03.206 --> 13:04.540
I couldn't care less.

13:04.624 --> 13:08.669
I was only ever a cog in the machine
to start with and I'm fully aware of that.

13:09.796 --> 13:14.217
Toshiro, I want you to take three months
to reflect on your actions.

13:24.101 --> 13:25.311
What's wrong?

13:25.394 --> 13:29.273
Well, it's just that, you defended me
and I was wondering why.

13:29.357 --> 13:30.817
It was the right thing to do.

13:32.944 --> 13:35.071
I'll never get promoted with you around.

13:38.449 --> 13:39.408
It's this way.

13:48.209 --> 13:50.628
The people who were
at the bottom of the stairs.

13:51.712 --> 13:53.297
Victims of Ivy.

13:57.844 --> 13:59.178
It's hard now,

13:59.262 --> 14:02.431
but you see awful things so often here
that you get used to it.

14:12.692 --> 14:15.361
It's time to play.

14:19.782 --> 14:21.409
Why are we playing a board game?

14:21.492 --> 14:22.618
Don't know.

14:24.871 --> 14:27.874
One, two, three, four.

14:27.957 --> 14:31.544
"You create a new species of fish
through genetic modification.

14:31.627 --> 14:33.796
It solves the food shortage crisis.

14:33.880 --> 14:35.298
Receive 30,000."

14:35.715 --> 14:39.260
Is that seriously all you get
for solving a food shortage crisis?

14:39.343 --> 14:40.469
How sad.

14:40.553 --> 14:41.804
Someone's taking a cut of it.

14:42.305 --> 14:44.390
Well, here's your 30,000.

14:44.473 --> 14:46.309
And here's your lucky card.

14:46.893 --> 14:48.561
Why are we doing this?

14:48.644 --> 14:51.606
You've got nothing do
while you're in here.

14:51.689 --> 14:54.567
I figured you could bond over
your pay cuts and suspensions.

14:54.650 --> 14:57.486
So just a group of losers
licking each other's wounds?

14:57.570 --> 14:59.822
Just hurry up and spin already.

15:05.828 --> 15:06.829
Huh?

15:07.830 --> 15:09.707
Wha… How much?

15:09.790 --> 15:11.375
This is the worst game ever!

15:15.546 --> 15:16.839
That really is so stupid!

15:16.923 --> 15:19.592
Even in a room full of losers,
you're losing.

15:20.051 --> 15:21.427
You idiots.

15:21.510 --> 15:24.096
Did you all forget that
I'm actually deputy chief?

15:45.952 --> 15:47.995
Stop on six! Stop on six! Or two!

15:48.079 --> 15:49.330
- Lose the 100,000!
- Eight!

15:49.413 --> 15:50.915
Come on! Stop on eight!

15:50.998 --> 15:51.999
Eight!

15:52.083 --> 15:54.043
I need to land on the stock market!

15:54.126 --> 15:55.962
Sorry to interrupt your fun.

15:56.629 --> 15:57.838
Yomiko Horai.

15:57.922 --> 16:00.841
I wanted to verify a couple of facts
with you regarding this case.

16:01.717 --> 16:02.593
Sure.

16:02.677 --> 16:03.844
This way.

16:11.727 --> 16:14.438
Ivy targeted you and I was wondering
if you knew the reason?

16:15.690 --> 16:19.568
Mm. I'm sorry,
but I really have no idea what it is.

16:19.652 --> 16:23.155
Well, I've been doing a bit of research
into your personal life.

16:23.239 --> 16:25.574
And, looks like
you come from a good family.

16:26.033 --> 16:28.202
You had a rebellious phase, though.

16:29.787 --> 16:31.580
But what's key here is four years ago.

16:31.664 --> 16:32.498
SHIIKA

16:32.581 --> 16:33.958
When you first joined Transflora Medical,

16:34.041 --> 16:37.044
you performed Transfloration
on a girl named Shiika Izumi.

16:38.629 --> 16:41.340
She's a victim of
the Human-Sourced Furniture business.

16:41.424 --> 16:43.551
Her Spiriflor was turned into furniture.

16:43.634 --> 16:45.845
She became part of someone's collection.

16:45.928 --> 16:49.098
Whoever arranged it
received a large sum of money for it.

16:49.724 --> 16:52.810
We believe that she was
related to Ivy in some way.

16:53.769 --> 16:55.438
Does she look familiar?

16:57.064 --> 16:58.232
She does.

16:58.315 --> 16:59.442
I remember her.

17:00.192 --> 17:02.194
Well, that's all I needed to know.

17:08.659 --> 17:09.660
Wait.

17:10.953 --> 17:12.121
Her furniture…

17:12.872 --> 17:14.540
Do you know what's gonna happen to it?

17:15.499 --> 17:17.168
It hasn't been found yet.

17:17.251 --> 17:19.545
Ivy stole it, so we have no idea
where it could be.

17:21.213 --> 17:22.715
Okay, I understand.

17:28.387 --> 17:31.307
Do you think you have
the right to feel sad about this?

17:31.390 --> 17:34.810
ISHIYONEYAMA

17:36.854 --> 17:39.106
Oh, hi! Glad you're better.

17:39.190 --> 17:40.691
Thanks for everything you've done.

17:43.861 --> 17:45.279
Transflora Medical 4.

17:55.998 --> 17:57.708
Transfloration is murder!

17:57.792 --> 17:58.709
- Ma'am.
- Huh?

17:59.835 --> 18:02.129
I'm sorry, but the road's
blocked off for the protest.

18:02.213 --> 18:05.091
It probably goes all the way over
to Transflora Medical 4.

18:05.174 --> 18:07.676
I heard that it's even worse
at the Transfloration Board.

18:08.677 --> 18:09.678
Now what?

18:09.762 --> 18:11.764
Down with Transfloration!

18:11.847 --> 18:13.265
Down with Transfloration!

18:13.349 --> 18:14.517
They're lying to us!

18:14.600 --> 18:15.935
It's a crime against humanity!

18:16.018 --> 18:18.521
Stop using the taxpayers money
on human experimentation!

18:18.604 --> 18:20.106
Give us back our money!

18:20.189 --> 18:22.274
Down with Transfloration!

18:22.358 --> 18:23.901
Down with the Oxygen Tax!

18:23.984 --> 18:25.653
Burn Transflora Medical to the ground!

18:25.736 --> 18:27.988
<i>Am I gonna be able to get to work?</i>

18:28.072 --> 18:29.198
Hey, you!

18:29.281 --> 18:31.283
You work at Transflora Medical, don't you?

18:31.367 --> 18:32.368
No, I swear I--

18:32.451 --> 18:35.913
Don't you realize all the pain and misery
that your company's causing people?

18:35.996 --> 18:37.706
Don't you feel anything?

18:37.790 --> 18:40.793
Do you even care?

18:42.586 --> 18:44.380
- What the fuck?
- What was that?

18:53.347 --> 18:55.766
Down with the entire
Transfloration system!

18:56.308 --> 18:57.643
Destroy everything!

19:00.437 --> 19:01.355
This way!

19:01.438 --> 19:02.481
Meg!

19:03.190 --> 19:04.483
Hurry! Get over--

19:04.567 --> 19:06.485
Dad, I can't…

19:10.531 --> 19:11.699
Damn it!

19:15.077 --> 19:16.120
Meg!

19:17.872 --> 19:19.290
Meg, no!

19:19.707 --> 19:20.541
Meg!

19:20.624 --> 19:23.544
<i>Any further rioting</i>
<i>will be met with force!</i>

19:23.627 --> 19:25.462
<i>This protest is over!</i>

19:25.546 --> 19:27.965
<i>I repeat, this protest is over!</i>

19:30.885 --> 19:31.802
Don't mess with us!

19:37.183 --> 19:38.559
You won't get away with this!

19:39.143 --> 19:43.397
<i>Today, large-scale Anti-Transfloration</i>
<i>protests took place all across the city.</i>

19:43.981 --> 19:46.317
<i>The Transfloration Board's</i>
<i>the one at fault here!</i>

19:47.109 --> 19:49.486
<i>They were the ones</i>
<i>who created that crazy thing!</i>

19:49.570 --> 19:51.071
<i>That monster!</i>

19:54.533 --> 19:57.786
<i>There wasn't a single</i>
<i>good thing about living.</i>

19:59.663 --> 20:01.540
<i>These protests were sparked by a tragic…</i>

20:01.624 --> 20:03.876
- Hey. Look at this.
- Huh? Oh.

20:05.169 --> 20:08.088
<i>The Transfloration Board stated,</i>
<i>"There is no record</i>

20:08.172 --> 20:10.090
<i>of the perpetrator having the procedure</i>

20:10.174 --> 20:12.801
<i>under the supervision</i>
<i>of the Transfloration Board."</i>

20:13.344 --> 20:16.138
So?
Is there anything wrong in the case file?

20:17.014 --> 20:20.226
If everything looks good,
then I'm going to give it to my aunt.

20:23.520 --> 20:25.397
What a bunch of nonsense.

20:25.481 --> 20:27.733
I mean, it wasn't even us who created Ivy.

20:29.109 --> 20:31.237
- Huh?
- Look.

20:33.906 --> 20:35.032
Uncaria?

20:35.574 --> 20:37.493
It's a Rubiaceae plant.

20:37.576 --> 20:40.746
It grows by extending its vines
and latching onto things.

20:41.330 --> 20:44.750
It's a destructive species
that inhibits the growth of other plants.

20:44.833 --> 20:47.253
Other countries consider it invasive.

20:48.212 --> 20:51.257
We don't have the Seeds
for that type of plant here.

20:51.966 --> 20:54.635
It wasn't Transflora Medical
that created Ivy.

20:57.054 --> 21:00.766
But still, this child was forced
to undergo Transfloration.

21:01.892 --> 21:04.520
So what then?
You think we should blame Yomiko?

21:05.312 --> 21:06.647
Come on, that's not what I said.

21:07.481 --> 21:08.732
Yomiko was only…

21:08.816 --> 21:10.109
She was doing her job.

21:11.735 --> 21:14.446
I mean what else should she have done?

21:15.781 --> 21:17.992
M<i>y sister was chosen for the Parade.</i>

21:18.826 --> 21:21.787
<i>That woman was the only one</i>
<i>who could stop the Parade.</i>

21:22.830 --> 21:25.666
Akira, do you know about the Parade?

21:25.749 --> 21:26.959
Yeah, I do.

21:27.042 --> 21:28.544
You mean the one in Paupertown, right?

21:28.627 --> 21:30.754
Yeah, I guess, but I'm not sure.

21:30.838 --> 21:32.256
What is it exactly?

21:32.339 --> 21:33.799
You heard about it from Ivy, right?

21:35.968 --> 21:37.219
Just as I thought.

21:38.262 --> 21:40.806
You can talk to Spiriflora, right?

21:42.433 --> 21:43.309
Okay, then.

21:44.059 --> 21:46.520
What are you planning to do
if I tell you about the Parade?

21:48.480 --> 21:50.399
I was thinking of…

21:50.482 --> 21:52.067
of going to Paupertown.

21:52.818 --> 21:54.361
I'm going to go with you then.

21:54.445 --> 21:56.322
I have some questions I want to ask there.

21:57.072 --> 21:58.407
We'll go tomorrow.

21:59.033 --> 22:00.409
Um, okay.

22:11.337 --> 22:12.463
What happened?

22:12.546 --> 22:13.672
You're late.

22:13.756 --> 22:14.757
Sorry.

22:22.931 --> 22:24.850
MS. KAORI KAMIYA
